From 474b0836133e1ef0fb6c91468da2e898e46c508f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 19:17:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Host Events system: data model, Discord bot, and Double
 Exam create/poll flow (Phase 1)

New database schema (events, event_cohost_slots, event_poll_votes, event_people, event_training_activities) supporting the full planned event lifecycle across all 7 event types, though only Double Exam is wired up end-to-end so far.

New can_host_events permission, following the same pattern as other granular permissions (division rank, user, and group rank levels).

New discord-bot/ directory: a standalone Node.js/discord.js bot meant to run on Railway (or similar), separate from the website. It is a thin messenger only - all state and decisions live in Supabase. Handles:
- Posting the Double Exam poll as a Components v2 message matching the provided format, with a live relative timestamp
- Role-gated reaction voting (Citizen role for one exam option, Private role for the other), stripping invalid reactions
- Co-host claim buttons in the Military server, preventing one person from claiming multiple events or two people claiming the same event
- Discord member search, used for host self-identification and (later) guard/spectator/passed tagging
- A small HTTP API secured by a shared secret, called from Supabase edge functions

New edge functions: create-double-exam, search-discord-members, get-vote-counts - all thin proxies/orchestrators between the website and the bot, keeping the bot's secret off the client.

Website: new Host Events tab (permission-gated), with an event type picker, a Double Exam creation form (asks the host to self-identify their Discord account once via search, then caches it), and a live status screen showing vote counts and co-host claims, auto-refreshing every 10s.

NOT yet built: decide/start/conclude screens, point-awarding on conclude, and the other 6 event types. See discord-bot/README.md for deployment steps - this requires a separate Railway deployment and Supabase edge function secrets that only the account owner can set up.
